          "type": "open",
          "q": "True or False: (a) The adjoint of [[2, 3], [1, −2]] is [[−2, −3], [−1, 2]]. (b) Adj A = Adj B for non-singular A and B implies A = B.",
          "answer": "(a) True — swap 2 and −2, negate 3 and 1: [[−2, −3], [−1, 2]].\n(b) False — for 3 × 3 matrices adj(−A) = (−1)² adj A = adj A, yet −A ≠ A.",
